cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TwinPane in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "TwinPane: A File, Folder, Table, Hex and Picture Comparison Tool for Windows"
abstract: >-
  TwinPane is a free, open-source desktop application for Windows that compares
  text files, folders, CSV tables, binary files and images. It provides
  side-by-side text diffs with word-level highlighting and block merging,
  recursive folder comparison and synchronization, key-based table comparison,
  byte-level hex comparison and pixel-level picture comparison. The text diff
  is based on Myers' O(ND) difference algorithm.
